  <header>
    <h1>Basic HDOC</h1>
    <author>Test Corpus</author>
    <date>2026-01-05</date>
  </header>
  <content>
    <p>This is a minimal, well-formed standalone HDOC document. It exists to prove the
    parser's happy path: a header, a short paragraph of body content, and nothing else
    unusual.</p>
    <p>A second paragraph, so there is more than one text node to anchor a connection to
    later.</p>
  </content>
